  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The salary supplement fund programme was discontinued due to government progress in anti-corruption action and increases in salaries for targeted civil servants.Remaining project funds were transferred to the Capacity Building Fund of the UNDP Governance Reform Programme. Funding is provided, on a competitive basis, to small projects implemented by the requesting institutions.</narrative>
